  ('cs_akron_history', 'plc_akron', 'overview', 'History',
   'Akron is a city in Summit County, Ohio, United States, and its county seat. It is located in Northeast Ohio along the Little Cuyahoga River, approximately 40 miles (64 km) south of Cleveland. Akron had a population of 190,469 at the 2020 census, making it the fifth-most populous city in Ohio. The Akron metropolitan area has an estimated 702,000 residents.', '["clm_wiki_akron_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
